    \includegraphics[width=1\linewidth]{img/mqtt.pdf}
    \caption{The subscription-publish model of the MQTT protocol involves devices 1, 2, and 3, all connecting to the MQTT Broker. Devices 2 and 3 have subscribed to a specific topic. Once device 1 publishes a new message on this topic, the Broker pushes the message to all devices subscribed to the topic, resulting in devices 2 and 3 receiving the message from device 1.}
