\subsubsection{Performance Anlaysis}

To verify the effectiveness of the Multi-Plane Network design, we conducted real-world experiments on our cluster, modifying the cluster's network topology to compare the performance of the \textbf{Multi-Plane Two-Layer Fat Tree (MPFT)} and the \textbf{Single-Plane Multi-Rail Fat Tree (MRFT)}. Below are the key findings from our experiments:

1. \textbf{All-to-All Communication and EP Scenarios}:  
