To evaluate MPFT's performance of all-to-all communication in practical training scenarios, we tested the EP communication patterns commonly used during training. As shown in Figure~\ref{alltoall_comparison}, each GPU achieves a high bandwidth exceeding 40GB/s in a multi-plane network, providing reliable performance that meets the demands of training.

