	\centering
        \includegraphics[width=0.45\textwidth]{pic/PFL_model_4.pdf}
	\caption{The diagram of PFL: In each round, every client trains its local model and its personalized model based on its local dataset and the global model broadcast by the server in the last round. Then, the clients perturb and upload their local models to the server, and the server aggregates the perturbed local models into the global model and broadcasts the global model.}
	\label{fig:PFL_model}
