\section{User Study 1: Comparing microGEXT and Baseline Conditions for Text Editing Command}

Study 1 investigates the feasibility of using microgestures for text editing tasks in virtual environments. We conducted a within-subjects user study ($N=20$), evaluating the impact of microGEXT on usability (e.g., user experience, system usability, and perceived workload) and utility (i.e., edit times and reattempts). The microGEXT was compared to a Baseline condition (see Section \ref{sec:Baseline}) to assess overall effectiveness.

