%
%
%
%
%
%
%
\end{itemize} 
The only thing left to remark is that the conditions of Lemma \ref{Lem:Step2} and Corollary \ref{Lem:Step4} can always be satisfied thanks to Remark \ref{rem:ConditionsAreEasyToSatisfy}. %
\end{proof}


