\section{Experimental Results and Analysis}
To validate the effectiveness of the proposed large language model for complex contract information extraction, we conduct experiments on an industrial contract dataset. The objective is to investigate the following three research questions:

RQ1: How effective is the proposed large language model for information extraction?

RQ2: Does LoRA fine-tuning improve the extraction accuracy of the large language model?

RQ3: What is the impact of data balancing and data augmentation on the model’s extraction accuracy and robustness?

\subsection{Experimental Data}
