As depicted in Figure~\ref{fig:time_composition}, \textit{Tady}'s total throughput is 5.26 MB/s. The CPU-bound preprocessing step accounts for a significant portion (37\%) of the total time. Despite this, \textit{Tady}'s overall performance remains considerably faster than IDA Pro, highlighting its substantial efficiency and practical applicability for large-scale binary analysis.



